@startuml
title OAuth 2.0 Authorization Code Flow
actor User
participant "Client App" as Client
participant "Auth Server" as Auth
participant "Resource API" as API

User -> Client: Click "Login"
Client -> Auth: GET /authorize?client_id=abc
Auth -> User: Show login page
User -> Auth: Enter credentials
Auth --> Client: Redirect with code
Client -> Auth: POST /token (code)
activate Auth
Auth --> Client: access_token, refresh_token
deactivate Auth
Client -> API: GET /me\nAuthorization: Bearer token
alt token valid
    API --> Client: 200 OK (profile)
else token expired
    API --> Client: 401 Unauthorized
    Client -> Auth: POST /token (refresh)
    Auth --> Client: new access_token
end
Client --> User: Show profile
@enduml
